WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Many girls envy me

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,200
Think I'm beautiful, gentle and kind

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,200
There must be a lot of people chasing you

4
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,400
but they don't know

5
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,200
Those people only like my appearance

6
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:08,800
No one really understands me

7
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,400
I've been a little envious of Keke lately.

8
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:11,400
At least she met one

9
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,000
The one who really holds her in the palm of his hand

10
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,000
do you really think

11
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,200
Do you envy Miko?

12
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,700
So what do you think of me?

13
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:19,130
You're fine if I have one

14
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:21,230
A boyfriend as considerate as you

15
00:00:21,230 --> 00:00:23,030
I'm sure I'll wake up from my dreams

16
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:24,630
Actually you are better than Miko

17
00:00:24,630 --> 00:00:25,530
If I were as beautiful as you

18
00:00:25,530 --> 00:00:26,530
A simple girlfriend

19
00:00:26,530 --> 00:00:27,530
It will definitely be better for you

20
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:28,830
I can't bear to make you suffer even the slightest bit of injustice

21
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:31,510
Komakiya

22
00:00:31,510 --> 00:00:32,610
if i say so

23
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:34,700
You don’t think I’m a scumbag, do you?

24
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,700
I mean you're really nice

25
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:37,940
thank you

26
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:39,740
But you are Keke’s boyfriend?

27
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:40,740
Of course I will also love Wuji

28
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:42,980
Mistakenly thought I was fine

29
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:45,480
It’s such a touching moment when the stars love each other

30
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:47,480
If there is no audience at this time

31
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:48,680
What a pity

32
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:50,380
Song Jingyi was injured while climbing a mountain

33
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:51,780
Sent to No. 11 Hospital

34
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:54,480
I'm a little worried about her condition. Can you check it out for me?

35
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:56,680
How is she? What a show?

36
00:00:56,680 --> 00:00:57,880
It's about to start
